{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52314","headline":"诗（幷序） 七十五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 七十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兀兀身死後，冥冥不自知。\n爲人[何]（可）必乐，爲鬼何[必]悲。\n[竞]（竟）地徒张眼，诤官慢竖眉。\n窟[里]（裹捋）长[展]（鹿）脚，[将]知我是谁（友）？\n（均从项校）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}